# Paths excluded from the Graphify code graph. Gitignore syntax.
#
# Added 2026-10-31. The vendored design-taste-frontend skill under .github/skills/
# is third-party tooling, not project code. Its live-browser.js is over 13,000 lines
# and every symbol it defines is a hub, so free-text `graphify query` kept answering
# with skill-script functions (showToast, teardown, initPageChat) instead of App.jsx.
# Excluding it also stopped vague queries from being truncated.
#
# This file can only exclude more than .gitignore does. It never re-includes anything.

.github/skills/
